message: "If you use or refer to this repository, please cite it using the metadata below."

title: "Education, Social Origin and Occupational Status in China"

type: software

license: MIT

authors:
  - family-names: "Yang"
    given-names: "Minghao"

version: "1.1.0"

date-released: "2026-10-01"

repository-code: "https://github.com/minghaoyang-research/education-stratification-china"

abstract: >-
  Reproducible R reconstruction of an undergraduate sociology dissertation
  using the 2017 China General Social Survey. The repository rebuilds the
  analytic sample and variables from the archived survey file, reproduces the
  seven submitted OLS models, and validates the R results against retained
  final SPSS output.

keywords:
  - sociology
  - social stratification
  - higher education
  - occupational status
  - CGSS
  - reproducibility
